emails.body:
Hi Team! 
First off I want to congratulate each and every member for being a part of the success of this first quarter and our insane growth as a company. To have a great wrap of this summer I want to sponsor the Eugene Marathon that takes place August 10th. I want all hands on this project to make it the most successful first sponsorship as a company. Please reach out to me with any questions. 
Best, CEO{serve}
